{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1856371524988743875","created_at":"2024-11-12T16:20:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1856371524988743875"],"id":"1856371524988743875","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":508,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"再给1个这轮比特币牛市的判断；\n很可能没有所谓的山寨全面牛市。\n本该流向山寨的钱，被meme接走，单单pump赚手续费，就几亿美金了。\n整个sol链的meme交易量，如果放到币安来，足够币安的山寨币整体涨一倍，链上已经承接了牛市。\n随着合规的进程和链上的崛起，CEX将在这轮牛市迎来最后的黄昏。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1856371524988743875"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1856369713091359075","created_at":"2024-11-12T16:13:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1856369713091359075"],"id":"1856369713091359075","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":450,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1843327831725707373","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这篇关于比特币启动节点的推文，含金量还在增加 https://t.co/qnmqwEsjWl","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1856369713091359075"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1843327831725707373","created_at":"2024-10-07T16:29:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1843327831725707373"],"id":"1843327831725707373","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":651,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"比特币有个时间窗口是下月美国大选，如果特朗普大概率当选，比特币会开启这一波的上涨走势。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1843327831725707373"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1842568265022980344","created_at":"2024-10-05T14:11:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1842568265022980344"],"id":"1842568265022980344","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":493,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"关于比特币的判断：去年10月中旬比特币拉第一根阳线，市场当时是出了SEC的乌龙，我在几个群给出观点：借辟谣洗盘接着拉，然后开启这轮行情，包括中途的SEC真正批准ETF，ETF在美股上市后加速攀升逐渐美股化。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1842568265022980344"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1842406726521454980","created_at":"2024-10-05T03:29:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1842406726521454980"],"id":"1842406726521454980","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":362,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"下周A股会有1-2只新的千元股走出来，伴随着个股的整体涨幅是10-20倍。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1842406726521454980"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1841919438989447674","created_at":"2024-10-03T19:13:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1841919438989447674"],"id":"1841919438989447674","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":245,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"4、5年没在圈里分享东西，最近心血来潮，打算在管理、运营、投资等方面写一些东西，当然不定时、不定期。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1841919438989447674"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1841917488390668802","created_at":"2024-10-03T19:05:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1841917488390668802"],"id":"1841917488390668802","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6629,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我一直说的一句话是分析、研究和投资是两码事，投资需要大家真实的到市场中去感受、真枪实弹的去战斗，不断试错、不断纠偏。\n分析和研究由于大脑的趋利记忆，只会加强你当初判断对的，会忽略掉你失误的，但往往那个失误的经验才是最宝贵的。由于当KOL要塑造自己的人设，在骗别人的同时也在骗自己。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1841917488390668802"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1841909330096095587","created_at":"2024-10-03T18:32:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1841909330096095587"],"id":"1841909330096095587","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1146,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近一堆KOL开始聊股票，清一色马后炮，大A吸血加密货币的逻辑，上周很早在几个群说。\n银之杰（A股龙头），启动第二天和朋友说要走一波流。节前单日18倍新股在128喊入，并在200告知要冲400后10分钟内冲400。\n说实话我打造的币姥爷被币安收购后，现在Web3中文区在跨金融和Web3领域1个能打的都木有。 https://t.co/sWxpYfCDw3","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1841909330096095587"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1843327831725707373","created_at":"2024-10-07T16:29:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1843327831725707373"],"id":"1843327831725707373","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":651,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"比特币有个时间窗口是下月美国大选，如果特朗普大概率当选，比特币会开启这一波的上涨走势。"}],"users":[{"id":"928496628570427392","name":"Mcfly","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1642759051338739718/WY7Hugml_normal.jpg","username":"Mcfly2140","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1856371524988743875","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3frqxrr8oi9ltrwa3mq0aq27phy7wjh","oldest_id":"1841909330096095587","result_count":8}}